      <activity id="d2e80117-3c65-5efc-adff-2d37913f0538" activityNameId="9424c397-1faf-56b0-b408-e707fde3d7a0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Benzyl alcohol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Benzyl alcohol, at plant
The process "benzyl alcohol, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of dimethylamine from methanol in Europe. Raw materials, auxilliaries, energy consumptions and emissions are modelled with data from US-production.  Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000100-51-6; 
Formula: C7H8O; 
UUID: 37cc3779-631f-37d6-9fee-bb335e4eeea0
Production of benzyl alcohol including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydrolysios of benzyl chloride
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_37cc3779-631f-37d6-9fee-bb335e4eeea0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
